        "title": "What IS tested (3 files, ~600 lines)",
        "content": "\n| File | What's covered |\n|---|---|\n| `execute.test.ts` | Auth guard, `guardExecute` allowlist/cost-bounds |\n| `policies.test.ts` | Tenant isolation, group privacy, posts, polls, chat, notifications, calendar, attachments, calls |\n| `user-admin-fields.test.ts` | Admin-only field protection |\n\n---\n\n",
